      "created_at": "2011-12-23T09:18:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes the more heroes you have the easier it will be. And there is no scaling in the base game.</p>\n<p>But I will say the expansion that will be coming out has introduced a way for scaling. For the most part they are still easier with more heroes, but not as easy as they would be if the scaling wasn’t there/</p>",
